# Docs and status sync

When finishing phase work, update **all** of:

| Source | Must reflect |
| --- | --- |
| `docs/ROADMAP.md` | Phase status (`done` / `planned`) |
| `docs/phases/phase-XX-*.md` | Status + acceptance checkboxes |
| Root `README.md` | Implementation status table |
| Matching web page | `StatusPill` / copy (not “in progress” for done phases) |

Feature docs live under `docs/` (e.g. `docs/strategies.md`, `docs/scanner.md`, `docs/paper-trading.md`) — not under `apps/docs/`.

Operator “what does this button do?” docs live under `docs/ui/` — update them whenever console controls change (see rule `ui-operator-guide`).

Do not invent future-phase features (ATR/RSI, Kronos, LLM) into earlier UI pages.
